Z||000000||Fformula88||10-17-2001||08:05 PM||||Tonight I saw a Honda CRX with its muffler removed and ahuge fart can on the end of the tailpipe.  I have no idea why, but he straight piped his exhaust where the muffler was  Maybe he thought it was the cat converter?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif">  He also used a pipe that couldn't have been more then an inch and a half in diameter.  It looked like that fart can was on the end of a straw!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Sounded like it too!  hehe  What some people will do.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">||||reg||12
